      "writtenOn": "2025-11-17T14:57:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The spec says to divide by 4000 and subtract 6. An offset of 24000 is 6 * 4000 so that looks fine, but shouldn\u0027t this be 4000? Same question for the serialize bit.",
