      "message": "Yes, good catch, that\u0027s the sort of bug that\u0027s going to happen when only testing serialize\u003c-\u003edeserialize round-trip.\n\nBTW, I think I\u0027m going to change the spec here to read\n```\n   (min(gain_curve_control_points_y[a][c], 48000) - 24000) * (1/4000)\n```\n\nThat\u0027s slightly numerically \"nicer\", and removes some of the confusion.",
